0..74 Comment "// What divergence as a row entry refuses (#1481): a loop at a row without"
75..166 Comment "// `Div`, a call of a diverging function from one, and a handler of `Div`. Each would let a"
167..242 Comment "// computation that never returns stand where one that returns is expected,"
243..300 Comment "// and an unread call of it be dropped. What checks is in"
301..343 Comment "// `../../model/control/divergence.gandr`."
